    <item>
      <title>1.0.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:18:09 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Dynamite 1.0 is the first stable public release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Caps Lock interrupts the offline indicator for its configured duration, then offline returns.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A taller menu bar icon with a larger, evenly inset cutout.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Timer menu actions stay tied to the displayed timer and appear only for available controls.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixes for rapid media-key input, alerts after sleep, and external brightness changes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Additional simultaneous finished timers retain native controls.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Silicon. Locally signed, not Apple-notarized; first launch may require Open Anyway.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/the-shoemaker/Dynamite/releases/download/v1.0.0/Dynamite-9.zip" length="2753566" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="2/DCc/kZKZIFYPXdxETdyszK8w0ikHVjUdLWvIKfcNsUSLi7IFYDiw+9vmJ+Tz+ucKP9h7PSztqrkI5SJtXUDQ=="></enclosure>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.1.4</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 05:19:26 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/the-shoemaker/Dynamite/releases/download/v0.1.4-beta.1/Dynamite-7.zip" length="2743122" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="IjxZOE0zfM4vf8cP4sT1TL6+bbviCcD05hFYO3wCCuptvT3Oj6QErBdX7Q4LkKcRhG2deIWdaWIyzEaLS3XlDQ=="></enclosure>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Internet status alerts, smoother activity replacement, preserved settings, and a cleaner interface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate offline and online alerts, with an optional always-visible offline status.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brief alerts replace the top status; long-running activities can use lower pills.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A proper Bluetooth icon and one AirPods connection alert.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smaller app and fewer unnecessary network checks during connection changes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
